    'You can check and choose from already created shadings, from <a href="https://tailwindcss.com/docs/customizing-colors" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Tailwind Color Palettes</a>.' => 'Puedes revisar y elegir entre los tonos ya creados en <a href="https://tailwindcss.com/docs/customizing-colors" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Paletas de colores de Tailwind</a>.',
