    'čisti učinkovito, ali ne ostavlja osjećaj “skinutog sloja” s kože' => 'limpia eficazmente sin dejar la piel tirante',
    'Pozdrav, <strong>{{NAME}}</strong>,<br /><br />Upravo ste primili novu donaciju od jednog posjetitelja.<br /><br /><strong>Email:</strong> {{EMAIL}}<br /><strong>Ime:</strong> {{PAYER_NAME}}<br /><strong>Iznos:</strong> {{TOTAL_AMOUNT}}<br /><strong>Valuta:</strong> {{CURRENCY}}<br /><strong>Procesor:</strong> {{PROCESSOR}}<br /><strong>Donacija:</strong> {{DONATION_TITLE}}<br /><strong>Poruka:</strong> {{MESSAGE}}<br /><br /><a href="{{GUEST_PAYMENT_LINK}}" class="cta">Prikaži uplatu</a><br /><br />Lijep pozdrav,<br />Tim {{WEBSITE_TITLE}}.' => 'Hola, <strong>{{NAME}}</strong>,<br /><br />Acabas de recibir una nueva donación de uno de tus visitantes.<br /><br /><strong>Correo electrónico:</strong> {{EMAIL}}<br /><strong>Nombre:</strong> {{PAYER_NAME}}<br /><strong>Importe total:</strong> {{TOTAL_AMOUNT}}<br /><strong>Moneda:</strong> {{CURRENCY}}<br /><strong>Procesador:</strong> {{PROCESSOR}}<br /><strong>Donación:</strong> {{DONATION_TITLE}}<br /><strong>Mensaje:</strong> {{MESSAGE}}<br /><br /><a href="{{GUEST_PAYMENT_LINK}}" class="cta">Ver pago</a><br /><br />Saludos,<br />El equipo de {{WEBSITE_TITLE}}.',
