    'Forever Aloe Berry Nectar® is the main Forever direction here as the aloe base people often choose when they want a gentler daily rhythm for the throat and respiratory system.' => 'Forever Aloe Berry Nectar® es la principal opción de Forever en este caso, como base de aloe que la gente suele elegir cuando busca un ritmo diario más suave para la garganta y el sistema respiratorio.',
    'Forever Logic Aloe Soothing Gel Moisture' => 'Forever Logic Aloe Soothing Gel Moisture',
    'Hello, <strong>{{NAME}}</strong>,<br /><br />This is a confirmation that your payment (#{{PAYMENT_ID}}) has been received by us.<br /><br />You\'ve paid for the <strong>{{PLAN_NAME}}</strong> plan until <strong>{{PLAN_EXPIRATION_DATE}}</strong>.<br /><br />You can also check all the <a href="{{USER_PAYMENTS_LINK}}">payments</a> you made, <a href="{{USER_PLAN_LINK}}">change your plan</a> or <a href="{{USER_PLAN_LINK}}">cancel it</a>.<br /><br />Regards,<br />The {{WEBSITE_TITLE}} team.' => 'Hola, <strong>{{NAME}}</strong>,<br /><br />Te confirmamos que hemos recibido tu pago (#{{PAYMENT_ID}}).<br /><br />Has pagado el plan <strong>{{PLAN_NAME}}</strong> hasta el <strong>{{PLAN_EXPIRATION_DATE}}</strong>.<br /><br />También puedes consultar todos los <a href="{{USER_PAYMENTS_LINK}}">pagos</a> que has realizado, <a href="{{USER_PLAN_LINK}}">cambiar de plan</a> o <a href="{{USER_PLAN_LINK}}">cancelarlo</a>.<br /><br />Saludos,<br />El equipo de {{WEBSITE_TITLE}}.',
