    'If you want a one-month frame, this is most often positioned as 3 x Forever Aloe Vera Gel™ and 1 x Forever Ultra Lite.' => 'Si quieres un plan para un mes, lo más habitual es recomendar 3 x Forever Aloe Vera Gel™ y 1 x Forever Ultra Lite.',
