    'Sensatiable comes as chewable tablets. Explore the formula and suggested use before adding it to your meal routine.' => 'Sensatiable se presenta en tabletas masticables. Explora la fórmula y el uso sugerido antes de incorporarlo a tu rutina de comidas.',
